<title>USA: LTX CFO John Arcari to resign as of Aug. 1.</title>
<headline>LTX CFO John Arcari to resign as of Aug. 1.</headline>
<dateline>WESTWOOD, Mass. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>LTX Corp said Wednesday that chief financial officer and treasurer John Arcari is resigning as of Aug. 1.</p>
<p>The company said controller Glenn Meloni will assume the post on an interim basis.</p>
<p>Arcari is leaving LTX to join Robotic Vision Systems Inc as vice president of finance, the company said.</p>
</text>
